     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><span style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Hi, I am kinda new to R-INLA and trying to implement one of the research issues.</span><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">I have four disease scenarios for which I am trying to do spatial analysis. For a given Country or State(districts), I am trying to see the co-existence of two diseases( all combinations) and expecting to see which states/districts have higher prevalence with co-existence of two diseases.</div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><br></div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">1. With this requirement, is R-INLA right place to go ahead with?</div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">2. If yes, then which model should be used? Below reference 1 uses BESAG2, which does not suit my requirement, I have tried to implement the reference 1 paper. But also BESAG model takes the adjacency matrix of the shapefile.</div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><br></div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">Below are the two research articles I referred:</div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\">1. <a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00477-018-1567-4\" style=\"font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00477-018-1567-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441027805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tcKMxieHP6964GqRIWZp_\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Etxeberria, J., T. Goicoa, and M. D. Ugarte. &quot;Joint modelling of brain cancer incidence and mortality using Bayesian age-and gender-specific shared component models.&quot; </span><i style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\">Stochastic Environmental Research and Risk Assessment</i></a><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><a href=\"https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00477-018-1567-4\" style=\"font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://link.springer.com/article/10.1007/s00477-018-1567-4&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441027805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1tcKMxieHP6964GqRIWZp_\"> 32.10 (2018): 2951-2969</a>.</span></div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">2. </span><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">H<a href=\"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1191/0962280205sm389oa\" style=\"font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1191/0962280205sm389oa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441027805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eYZBW-7mTEvYnFKuQtWxG\">eld, Leonhard, et al. &quot;Towards joint disease mapping.&quot; </a></span><i style=\"font-family:Arial,sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1191/0962280205sm389oa\" style=\"font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1191/0962280205sm389oa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441027805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eYZBW-7mTEvYnFKuQtWxG\">Statistical methods in medical research</a></i><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><a href=\"https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1191/0962280205sm389oa\" style=\"font:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://journals.sagepub.com/doi/abs/10.1191/0962280205sm389oa&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441027805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eYZBW-7mTEvYnFKuQtWxG\"> 14.1 (2005): 61-82</a>. -&gt; This papers uses BYM model but trying to estimate the relative risk with the independent variables affecting a particular cancer</span></div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><br></span></div><div style=\"font-variant-numeric:inherit;font-variant-east-asian:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;line-height:inherit;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\">Your help will be really appreciated.</span></div><div><span style=\"font-style:inherit;font-variant:inherit;font-weight:inherit;font-stretch:inherit;font-size:inherit;line-height:inherit;font-family:Arial,sans-serif;vertical-align:baseline;color:inherit\"><br></span></div></div>"
