     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word;line-break:after-white-space\">Hi,<div><br></div><div>We have been working on the implementation of some multivariate spatial models with INLA using rgeneric:</div><div><br></div><div><a href=\"https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.10804\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.10804&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792441027805000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3QH-GDUOpk1yTEK2dGrHOz\">https://arxiv.org/abs/1909.10804</a></div><div><br></div><div>This will allow you to compute the correlation between different diseases.</div><div><br></div><div>The package is available on CRAN, but if you plan to use we have a newer version.</div><div><br></div><div>Best,</div><div><br></div><div>Virgilio</div></div>"
